{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415736","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415736","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1041573601:1":{"text":"ホットドリンク？嫌な名前ねぇ。","source_cn":"加热的饮品？真是惹人心烦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBCC02F36A60005FE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041573602:1":{"text":"あら？そんなに縮こまってどうしたの？吹雪に取り残されたひな鳥みたい。","source_cn":"呵，你怎么是一副蜷缩的模样，像只被暴雪困住的雏鸟。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8FEFCEF81EBFC781","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041573603:1":{"text":"そ、そこのお嬢さん……そろそろ、オレの舌が、凍っちまいそうなんよ……","source_cn":"这、这位……女士，我的舌头，快要砸到脚上了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF74C2FB28A40FE83","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041573604:1":{"text":"こんな寒さじゃ……ろくに、喋れもせん……","source_cn":"鬼天气……呼……差不多，该……该结束谈话了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF72BB28E487DC3F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041573605:1":{"text":"あら、もうお喋りはおしまい？","source_cn":"这么快就要结束了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA115E6CC6315EE79","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041573606:1":{"text":"涼しくて気持ちいいじゃない。もしかして寒いのかしら？","source_cn":"这恰到好处的清凉，难道会让你感到不适吗，亲爱的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB3EC0FC39C2DFC69","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041573607:1":{"text":"見て。あなたの吐く白い息が、私の手のひらで踊っているわ。もっとこの雰囲気を楽しみましょう。","source_cn":"你看，连你呼出的白雾都在我的掌心跳舞，我们的游戏才刚刚...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x782ECB83BA28AED7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041573608:1":{"text":"わ、分かった……ほんなら、へ、変身してから……話そうや……","source_cn":"呼……既然这样……变……变形之后……我们慢慢聊……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA81909DCB8F04912","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041573609:1":{"text":"ふぅ……だいぶあったこうなった。凍った思考を温泉に投げ込んだみたいに、考えが次々ほぐれていくぞ。","source_cn":"现在暖和多了，感觉像是把冻僵的思路一下子扔进了温泉里，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F165B6FAC73157B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041573610:1":{"text":"それじゃ、氷のお嬢さん。話の続きをしようかの。吹雪の話やったかな？","source_cn":"好了，冰霜女士，你刚才想说冰风还是什么来着？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x292A2BF814557679","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041573611:1":{"text":"あら？外見だけじゃ